            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-neutral-900">
              <a href="/sablon/cek-senet-ve-vade-risk-sistemi" class="hover:text-emerald-800 hover:underline">Çek–Senet ve Vade Risk Sistemi</a>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Vadeli çek ve senetlerin tahsilat takvimini izlemek için Çek-Senet Risk sistemini kullanın.</p>
            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-neutral-100 flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">799 TL</span>
              <a href="/sablon/cek-senet-ve-vade-risk-sistemi" class="text-emerald-800 font-semibold hover:underline">Detaylar →</a>
